WEBVTT

00:09:28.846 --> 00:09:30.726
which is a far more gentle impulse,

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:35.025
that doesn't require that you sacrifice
your entire life for something.

00:09:35.049 --> 00:09:38.383
It's more of kind of a scavenger hunt,

00:09:38.407 --> 00:09:42.604
where you're allowed to pick up
these tiny little beautiful clues

00:09:42.628 --> 00:09:43.786
along the pathway,

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:45.708
and it's more of a tap on the shoulder

00:09:45.732 --> 00:09:48.342
that asks you turn your attention
one inch to the left.

00:09:48.366 --> 00:09:51.098
"Oh, that's a little bit
mildly interesting. What is that?

00:09:51.122 --> 00:09:54.441
OK, now I'm going to take that clue
another inch and another inch,"

00:09:54.465 --> 00:09:57.820
rather than this idea
that the symphony is born whole,

00:09:57.844 --> 00:10:00.305
because you sit down
and you're struck by lightning